Now make the web.

Instead of:

word → definition

use:

word → meanings → shared operator → neighboring junctions

So one local patch looks like:

root → origin → generation → branch → divergence → path → trajectory → vector → direction → field → interaction → force → tension → resolution → cadence → music

And another:

bit → unit → distinction → signal → information → key → decoding → meaning → frame → interpretation → state → transition → time → beat → measure → music

They reconnect.

That means the web isn’t really lexical. It’s an operator graph.

